  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After fighting soul battlefield breaks in Yu Lu blessed land, the invading immortals enter another battlefield killer move, Eight Doors Labyrinth. Sky and ground are orange; eight huge doors stand around them and little else. Xie Shu Fang warns that the move is used specially to trap enemies: it lacks fighting soul battlefield’s killing nature, yet is harder to deal with.",
      "chapters": [
        905
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "char_xie_shu_fang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Historically it is very famous. Trapped Gu Immortals lose their sense of direction to a huge extent. Each door admits only one life form, then disappears, so the eight doors give only eight exploration chances and force solo progress afterward. Rumors describe eight areas with eight doors each and only one correct path; wrong choices loop. Without a wisdom path Gu Immortal skilled at deductions, fighters can stay trapped until they die. Unlike earlier battlefield moves, outsiders cannot probe it safely. Shark Demon’s group retreats with Profound Ice House after fighting soul battlefield rather than risk the labyrinth then.",
      "chapters": [
        905
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_shark_demon",
        "house_profound_ice_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan as Xing Xiang Zi breaks the labyrinth.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "labyrinth-unraveling",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As a wisdom path grandmaster he leads the group for tens of blessed-land days and thoroughly unravels Eight Doors Labyrinth, opening Yu Lu blessed land’s true appearance. He had once thought he would need star thought Immortal Gu to have a chance; he does it without that Gu while multitasking other work.",
      "chapters": [
        916
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "labyrinth-unraveling",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_star_thought_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the barrier falls, the true scenery appears before the immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        917
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "labyrinth-unraveling",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "How far he understands the three Yu Lu battlefield layers after refining star thought Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-grasp",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "With star thought Immortal Gu later refined, he grasps eighty to ninety percent of freezing rain frozen earth, fighting soul battlefield, and eight doors labyrinth, even without the Immortal Gu needed to recreate those battlefield killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        982
      ],
